      "message": "Why is this needed? Instead of:\n  java_library {\n    name: \"foo\",\n    is_uses_lib: true,\n  }\n\nCould you not just put:\n  java_library {\n    name: \"foo\",\n    uses_libs: [\"foo\"],\n  }",
