      "writtenOn": "2020-09-02T13:34:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack. AIUI this is really a temporary work around because some uses_libs have not yet been switched to using java_sdk_library. Longer term we will switch to using java_sdk_library and so this property will not be needed. If correct then I think that we should restrict use of this property (using neverallow rules) to only those instances that currently need it to avoid any more usages being added.",
      "parentUuid": "cebc3ca7_adfd240d",
      "revId": "21a73752054595c0e3cad5fa38dbedc2218998a2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
